{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把熟悉的柔软重新出现写成亲近感回到心里、心随之软下来，没有把珠子的比喻写成真实人物、场景或行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"记得亲近曾带来的满足，因而愿意继续珍惜片刻，是心理上的停留意愿，没有把回头看一眼的比喻写成真实动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"松口气是心理上的放松表达，短暂安静和难题仍会回来也符合喘息并未真正安顿的含义。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-6已经说明他允许自己相信那份向往，满足和柔软重新回来，足以唤起此处的熟悉亲近感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-7明确说满足使他舍不得把心思拉回现实，直接解释了为什么愿意再多停留片刻。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-4说明怎样争取而不伤温柔的问题仍未解决，足以解释眼下的安静为什么只是暂时的。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条线形成了清楚的心理过程：熟悉的亲近重新出现，回忆起它带来的满足，愿意停留片刻，随后获得短暂喘息但仍知道现实问题没有解决。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f181819e-ce9f-4c31-8e13-8f5bd5e6feef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233032414795Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.218, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:31:18.652490+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "15fa18e1b50e19ebdc484096b82f31fb309b5c0d7f3c3a0983a05f2993f37a35", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "me